# Unicode CLDR 47, locale ro, cldr-units-full/main/ro/units.json,
# duration-second: one "secundă", few/other "secunde".  "secunda" is the
# same singular with the final vowel written unaccented, the spelling
# unaccented Romanian input produces -- unit_hour.voc ships "ora" beside
# "oră" for the same reason.
secundă
secunda
secunde
